    {
      "id": "INIT-PPF-001",
      "text": "A platform profile interface shall be an atomic extension contract that encapsulates hosting-platform-specific repository establishment behavior behind a defined boundary."
    },
    {
      "id": "INIT-PPF-002",
      "text": "The platform profile interface shall define the required operations that a profile must implement, the inputs it receives from the initializer, and the outputs or side effects it produces, without constraining the internal implementation of those operations."
